n         'stored': page.evaluate(\"() => localStorage.getItem('jamo.settings')\"),\n         'daily_saved': page.evaluate(\"() => Object.keys(localStorage).filter(k => k.startsWith('jamo.daily')).map(k => JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(k)).hardMode)\")}\n    page.reload(); page.wait_for_selector('#board .tile'); page.wait_for_timeout(200)\n    a['after_reload_checkbox'] = settings_box(page)\n    a['errors'] = page._errors\n    out['A_hard_cross_mode'] = a\n    page._context.close()\n\n    # A2: 날마다 빈 판에서 하드 켬 → 연습(이미 만든 빈 판) 으로 → 체크박스\n    page = bm.open_page(b, base)\n    bm.dismiss_help(page)\n    page.click('#mode-practice'); page.click('#mode-daily')\n    page.click('#btn-settings'); page.check('#set-hard'); page.keyboard.press('Escape')\n    page.click('#mode-practice')\n    out['A2_practice_checkbox_after_daily_on'] = settings_box(page)\n    page._context.close()\n\n    # B: 연습에서 진 뒤 날이 바뀜(포커스) → 연습 판의 정답 토스트\n    page = bm.open_page(b, base, init_scripts=[\"Math.random = () => 0;\", SHIFT_DATE])\n    bm.dismiss_help(page)\n    page.click('#mode-practice')\n    lose(page)\n    bb = {'before': bm.answer_toasts(page)}\n    page.evaluate(\"() => { globalThis.__off = 86400000; window.dispatchEvent(new Event('focus')); }\")\n    page.wait_for_timeout(300)\n    bb['after_new_day'] = bm.toast_texts(page)\n    bb['mode_practice_pressed'] = page.get_attribute('#mode-practice', 'aria-pressed')\n    bb['board_last_row'] = bm.row_text(page, 5)\n    page.click('#mode-daily'); page.click('#mode-practice')\n    bb['after_roundtrip'] = bm.answer_toasts(page)\n    bb['errors'] = page._errors\n    out['B_new_day_in_practice'] = bb\n    page._context.close()\n\n    # C: 320px 어두운 테마 + 진 연습 판 정답 토스트 + 모드 줄\n    page = bm.open_page(b, base, viewport={'width': 320, 'height': 640}, color_scheme='dark',\n                        init_scripts=[\"Math.random = () => 0;\"])\n    bm.dismiss_help(page)\n    page.click('#mode-practice')\n    lose(page)\n    c = page.evaluate(\"\"\"() => {